        {
          "text": "Nkabela ndakabona munzi mulemu, Jerusalemu mupya, uuza buseluka kuzwa kujulu kwa-Leza, ulibambidwe mbuli nabwiinga mbwalisakatizizya mulumi wakwe. ",
