        {
          "text": "Elyo ndakamvwa ijwi ipati lizwa kucuuno cabwami, lyakati, Amubone, bukalo bwa-Leza mpobuli akati kabantu, uzookala akati kabo. Bazooba bantu bakwe, alakwe Leza mwini uzookala kulimbabo, azoobe Leza wabo. ",
