          "text": "Pele bakandu abatasyomi abasesemyi abajayi abasibwaamu abalozi abakomba mituni ababeji, boonse bayoopegwa lukono lwabo muziba liyaka mulilo asulufa, ndilyonya ndolufu lwabili.",
