          "text": "Lino kwakasika umwi wabaabo baangelo bali musanu ababili ibakajisi mitiba iili musanu aibili iizwide zipenzyo zili musanu azibili zyakumamanino. Wakandaambila kuti, Boola, nkakutondezye nabwiinga, mwanakazi waMwanambelele. ",
