                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munzi uliyakidwe azyooko zyone, zyoonse zileelene, bulamfu buleelene abwaamba. Nkabela wakeeleka munzi atete, wajana kuti mamaile aali myaanda iili ikumi aisanu. Bulamfu abwaamba abwiime bwawo, zyoonse zileelene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
