              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakeeleka bwaanda bwawo, wajana kuti buli azikokola zili mwaanda amakumi one azine, mbuli kweeleka kwamuntu, nkukuti kwaangelo.",
          "type": "text",
