                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela munzi tuuyandi kumunikilwa izuba nuuba mweezi, nkaambo bulemu bwa-Leza mbobuumunikila, alimwi ilampi lyawo ngu-Mwanambelele. ",
          "type": "text",
