          "text": "Lino omo mumunzi tamukooyoonjila cintu niciba comwe cisofwaazya, nibaba bantu bacita zisesemyo nanka kubeja, pele abo balike balembedwe mazina aabo mubbuku lyabuumi lya-Mwanambelele.",
